            "answer": {
              "short": "$9$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{5}\\text{ of }45&=\\frac{1}{5}\\times\\frac{45}{1}\\\\&=\\frac{1\\times45}{5\\times1}\\\\&=\\frac{45}{5}\\\\&=9\\end{align*}$$",
